{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34251","headline":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶坞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶坞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茗地曲隈回，野行多缭绕。\n向阳就中密，背涧差还少。\n遥盘云髻慢，乱簇香篝小。\n何处好幽期，满岩春露晓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}